                            ${['A/B Testing', 'Repurposing', 'Boosting', 'Klarifikasi PR'].map(a => `<option value="${a}" ${ev.actionTaken === a ? 'selected' : ''}>${a}</option>`).join('')}
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-semibold mb-1">Catatan Evaluasi & Pembelajaran</label>
                    <textarea id="ed-auditnotes" rows="3" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800">${escapeHtml(ev.auditNotes)}</textarea>
                </div>
            </div>`;
        }

        function saveDrawerChanges() {
            const item = appState.items.find(i => i.id === activeDetailId);
            if (!item) return;

            if (activeDrawerTab === 1) {
                item.title = document.getElementById('ed-title').value.trim() || item.title;
                item.campaign = document.getElementById('ed-campaign').value.trim() || item.campaign;
                item.research.peso = document.getElementById('ed-peso').value;
                item.research.funnel = document.getElementById('ed-funnel').value;
                item.research.issueRisk = document.getElementById('ed-risk').value;
                item.research.kpiMetric = document.getElementById('ed-kpimetric').value;
                item.research.kpiTarget = Number(document.getElementById('ed-kpitarget').value) || 0;
                item.research.pillar = document.getElementById('ed-pillar').value;
                item.research.format = document.getElementById('ed-format').value;
                item.research.audience = document.getElementById('ed-audience').value;
                item.research.issueAudit = document.getElementById('ed-issue').value;
                item.research.competitorNotes = document.getElementById('ed-comp').value;
            } else if (activeDrawerTab === 2) {
                item.planning.brief = document.getElementById('ed-brief').value;
                item.planning.outline = document.getElementById('ed-outline').value;
                item.planning.needsBriefRevision = document.getElementById('ed-revbrief').checked;
                item.planning.briefRevisionNote = document.getElementById('ed-revbriefnote').value;
                item.planning.takeDate = document.getElementById('ed-takedate').value;
                item.planning.publishDate = document.getElementById('ed-pubdate').value;
                item.planning.publishTime = document.getElementById('ed-pubtime').value;
                item.planning.crew = document.getElementById('ed-crew').value.split(',').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean);
                item.planning.location = document.getElementById('ed-location').value;
                item.planning.travelEstimate = document.getElementById('ed-travel').value;
            } else if (activeDrawerTab === 3) {
                item.production.stage = document.getElementById('ed-stage').value;
                item.production.preProdChecklist = {
                    kamera: document.getElementById('chk-kamera').checked,
                    audio: document.getElementById('chk-audio').checked,
                    lighting: document.getElementById('chk-lighting').checked,
                    briefingMeet: document.getElementById('chk-meet').checked
                };
                item.production.qcChecklist = {
                    visualAudio: document.getElementById('qc-visual').checked,
                    tonePR: document.getElementById('qc-tone').checked,
                    brandSafety: document.getElementById('qc-safety').checked,
                    akurasiData: document.getElementById('qc-data').checked
                };
            } else if (activeDrawerTab === 4) {
                const checkedChannels = [...document.querySelectorAll('input[name="ed-channels"]:checked')].map(el => el.value);
                item.distribution.channels = checkedChannels;
                item.distribution.published = document.getElementById('ed-published').checked;
                item.distribution.sentiment = {
                    positive: Number(document.getElementById('ed-sent-pos').value) || 0,
                    neutral: Number(document.getElementById('ed-sent-neu').value) || 0,
                    negative: Number(document.getElementById('ed-sent-neg').value) || 0
                };
                item.distribution.mentions = Number(document.getElementById('ed-mentions').value) || 0;
                item.distribution.responseStatus = document.getElementById('ed-respstatus').value;
            } else if (activeDrawerTab === 5) {
                item.evaluation.kpiActual = Number(document.getElementById('ed-kpiactual').value) || 0;
                item.evaluation.auditCause = document.getElementById('ed-auditcause').value;
                item.evaluation.actionTaken = document.getElementById('ed-actiontaken').value;
                item.evaluation.auditNotes = document.getElementById('ed-auditnotes').value;
            }

            saveState();
            renderDrawerContent();
            renderCurrentView();
            showToast('success', 'Perubahan Disimpan', `Data "${item.title}" berhasil diperbarui ke localStorage.`);
        }

        function advancePhase(itemId, targetPhase, stayInDrawer = false) {
            const item = appState.items.find(i => i.id === itemId);
            if (!item) return;
            item.phase = targetPhase;
            saveState();
            showToast('success', `Berpindah ke Fase ${targetPhase}`, `"${item.title}" kini berada di ${PHASE_META[targetPhase].name}.`);
            if (stayInDrawer && activeDetailId === itemId) {
                activeDrawerTab = targetPhase;
                renderDrawerContent();
            }
            renderCurrentView();
        }

        /* =====================================================================
           14. TAMBAH KONTEN BARU, HAPUS, RESET & EXPORT CSV
           ===================================================================== */
        function openNewContentModal(defaultPhase = 1) {
            document.getElementById('new-content-form').reset();
            document.getElementById('nc-phase').value = String(defaultPhase);
            const modal = document.getElementById('new-content-modal');
            modal.classList.remove('hidden');
            modal.classList.add('flex');
            lucide.createIcons();
        }

        function closeNewContentModal() {
            const modal = document.getElementById('new-content-modal');
            modal.classList.add('hidden');
            modal.classList.remove('flex');
        }

        function submitNewContent(e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            const newItem = {
                id: 'pr-' + Date.now(),
                title: document.getElementById('nc-title').value.trim(),
                campaign: document.getElementById('nc-campaign').value.trim(),
                phase: Number(document.getElementById('nc-phase').value) || 1,
                research: {
                    audience: 'Publik & Media Nasional',
                    trends: 'Tren industri terkini',
                    issueAudit: 'Belum ada catatan isu khusus.',
                    issueRisk: document.getElementById('nc-risk').value,
                    funnel: document.getElementById('nc-funnel').value,
                    kpiMetric: 'Impressions / Engagement',
                    kpiTarget: 50000,
                    pillar: document.getElementById('nc-pillar').value.trim() || 'Reputasi Korporasi',
                    peso: document.getElementById('nc-peso').value,
                    competitorNotes: '-',
                    format: 'Artikel + Konten Visual'
                },
                planning: {
                    brief: 'Lengkapi creative brief di sini.',
                    outline: '1. Hook\n2. Pesan Utama\n3. CTA',
                    needsBriefRevision: false,
                    briefRevisionNote: '',
                    takeDate: '2026-12-03',
                    publishDate: '2026-12-10',
                    publishTime: '19:00',
                    crew: ['Andi (PR Lead)'],
                    location: 'Kantor Pusat Jakarta',
                    travelEstimate: '15 menit',
                    gcalSynced: false,
                    gdriveGenerated: false,
                    gdriveFolders: []
                },
                production: {
                    stage: 'pra_produksi',
                    preProdChecklist: { kamera: false, audio: false, lighting: false, briefingMeet: false },
                    qcChecklist: { visualAudio: false, tonePR: false, brandSafety: false, akurasiData: false },
                    revisions: []
                },
                distribution: {
                    channels: ['Instagram', 'LinkedIn'],
                    published: false,
                    sentiment: { positive: 0, neutral: 0, negative: 0 },
                    mentions: 0,
                    responseStatus: 'Belum Direspon'
                },
                evaluation: {
                    kpiActual: 0,
                    auditCause: '',
                    auditNotes: '',
                    actionTaken: '',
                    archived: false
                }
            };

            appState.items.unshift(newItem);
            saveState();
            closeNewContentModal();
            showToast('success', 'Konten Baru Dibuat', `"${newItem.title}" ditambahkan ke Fase ${newItem.phase}.`);
            renderCurrentView();
            openDetailDrawer(newItem.id, newItem.phase);
        }

        function showConfirmModal(title, desc, onYes) {
            document.getElementById('confirm-title').textContent = title;
            document.getElementById('confirm-desc').textContent = desc;
            const yesBtn = document.getElementById('confirm-btn-yes');
            yesBtn.onclick = () => {
                closeConfirmModal();
                onYes();
            };
            const modal = document.getElementById('confirm-modal');
            modal.classList.remove('hidden');
            modal.classList.add('flex');
            lucide.createIcons();
        }

        function closeConfirmModal() {
            const modal = document.getElementById('confirm-modal');
            modal.classList.add('hidden');
            modal.classList.remove('flex');
        }

        function confirmDeleteItem(itemId) {
            showConfirmModal(
                'Hapus Konten PR?',
                'Konten ini akan dihapus permanen dari workspace Anda.',
                () => {
                    appState.items = appState.items.filter(i => i.id !== itemId);
                    saveState();
                    closeDetailDrawer();
                    renderCurrentView();
                    showToast('info', 'Konten Dihapus', 'Item telah dihapus dari workspace.');
                }
            );
        }

        function openResetConfirm() {
            showConfirmModal(
                'Reset ke Data Demo?',
                'Semua perubahan Anda saat ini akan diganti dengan 6 kampanye PR demo awal.',
                () => {
                    appState = getInitialDemoData();
                    saveState();
                    closeDetailDrawer();
                    renderCurrentView();
                    showToast('success', 'Data Demo Dipulihkan', '6 kampanye PR realistis siap digunakan kembali.');
                }
            );
        }

        function exportToCSV() {
            const headers = ['ID', 'Judul', 'Kampanye', 'Fase', 'PESO', 'Funnel', 'Risiko Isu', 'Target KPI', 'KPI Aktual', 'Tanggal Take', 'Tanggal Tayang', 'Kru', 'Dipublikasikan', 'Sentimen Positif (%)', 'Sentimen Negatif (%)'];
            const rows = appState.items.map(i => [
                i.id,
                `"${(i.title || '').replace(/"/g, '""')}"`,
                `"${(i.campaign || '').replace(/"/g, '""')}"`,
                `Fase ${i.phase}`,
                i.research.peso,
                i.research.funnel,
                i.research.issueRisk,
                i.research.kpiTarget,
                i.evaluation.kpiActual,
                i.planning.takeDate,
                i.planning.publishDate,
                `"${(i.planning.crew || []).join('; ')}"`,
                i.distribution.published ? 'Ya' : 'Belum',
                i.distribution.sentiment.positive,
                i.distribution.sentiment.negative
            ]);

            const csvContent = '\uFEFF' + [headers.join(','), ...rows.map(r => r.join(','))].join('\n');
            const blob = new Blob([csvContent], { type: 'text/csv;charset=utf-8;' });
            const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
            const a = document.createElement('a');
            a.href = url;
            a.download = `PRFlow_Laporan_Content_Planner_${new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}.csv`;
            document.body.appendChild(a);
            a.click();
            document.body.removeChild(a);
            URL.revokeObjectURL(url);

            showToast('success', 'Laporan CSV Diunduh', 'File siap dibuka di Google Sheets atau Microsoft Excel.');
        }

        /* =====================================================================
           15. UI UTILITIES: NOTIFIKASI, TOAST, DARK MODE, MOBILE SIDEBAR
           ===================================================================== */
        function toggleNotifications() {
            document.getElementById('notif-panel').classList.toggle('hidden');
        }

        function renderNotifications() {
            const list = document.getElementById('notif-list');
            const dot = document.getElementById('notif-dot');
            const unread = appState.notifications.filter(n => !n.read).length;

            if (unread > 0) dot.classList.remove('hidden');
            else dot.classList.add('hidden');

            list.innerHTML = appState.notifications.length === 0
                ? `<div class="p-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-400">Belum ada notifikasi.</div>`
                : appState.notifications.map(n => `
                <div class="p-3.5 text-xs ${n.read ? 'opacity-70' : 'bg-brand-50/40 dark:bg-brand-950/20'}">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                        <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">${escapeHtml(n.title)}</strong>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 shrink-0">${n.time}</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-0.5">${escapeHtml(n.message)}</p>
                </div>`).join('');
        }

        function markAllNotificationsRead() {
            appState.notifications.forEach(n => n.read = true);
            saveState();
        }

        function showToast(type, title, message) {
            const container = document.getElementById('toast-container');
            const colors = {
                success: 'border-emerald-300 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-900 dark:bg-emerald-950 dark:border-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-100',
                warning: 'border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 text-amber-900 dark:bg-amber-950 dark:border-amber-800 dark:text-amber-100',
                info: 'border-brand-300 bg-white text-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:border-brand-800 dark:text-slate-100'
            };

            const toast = document.createElement('div');
            toast.className = `pointer-events-auto p-4 rounded-2xl border shadow-lg text-xs transition-all transform translate-y-2 opacity-0 ${colors[type] || colors.info}`;
            toast.innerHTML = `<div class="font-bold">${escapeHtml(title)}</div><div class="opacity-85 mt-0.5">${escapeHtml(message)}</div>`;
            container.appendChild(toast);

            requestAnimationFrame(() => {
                toast.classList.remove('translate-y-2', 'opacity-0');
            });

            setTimeout(() => {
                toast.classList.add('opacity-0', 'translate-y-2');
                setTimeout(() => toast.remove(), 300);
            }, 3800);
        }

        function toggleMobileSidebar(open) {
            const sb = document.getElementById('sidebar');
            const bd = document.getElementById('sidebar-backdrop');
            if (open) {
                sb.classList.remove('-translate-x-full');
                bd.classList.remove('hidden');
            } else {
                sb.classList.add('-translate-x-full');
                bd.classList.add('hidden');
            }
        }

        function initTheme() {
            const saved = localStorage.getItem(THEME_KEY);
            const prefersDark = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;
            const isDark = saved ? saved === 'dark' : prefersDark;
            document.documentElement.classList.toggle('dark', isDark);
            updateThemeIcon();
        }

        function toggleTheme() {
            const isDark = document.documentElement.classList.toggle('dark');
            localStorage.setItem(THEME_KEY, isDark ? 'dark' : 'light');
            updateThemeIcon();
            if (currentView === 'phase5') renderCurrentView();
        }

        function updateThemeIcon() {
            const isDark = document.documentElement.classList.contains('dark');
            ['theme-icon', 'landing-theme-icon'].forEach(id => {
                const icon = document.getElementById(id);
                if (icon) icon.setAttribute('data-lucide', isDark ? 'sun' : 'moon');
            });
            lucide.createIcons();
        }

        // Tutup dropdown notifikasi saat klik di luar
        document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
            const panel = document.getElementById('notif-panel');
            if (panel && !panel.classList.contains('hidden')) {
                if (!e.target.closest('#notif-panel') && !e.target.closest('[onclick="toggleNotifications()"]')) {
                    panel.classList.add('hidden');
                }
            }
        });

        /* =====================================================================
           16. INISIALISASI APLIKASI
           ===================================================================== */
        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            initTheme();
            if (currentSession) {
                showWorkspaceView();
            } else {
                showLandingView('home');
            }
        });
    </script>
